# PUBG Shorts — Global Config

Source prefs: `edit_preferences.yaml`. Apply unless the user overrides for that run.

## HARD RULE — GPU / thermal (never violate)
This PC previously hit **99% CPU / ~85–90°C and auto-restarted**. Treat CPU as scarce.

- **All high-intensity video work MUST use GPU**: decode `cuda`, encode `h264_nvenc` (or hevc_nvenc). No CPU libx264/libx265 for finals.
- **ffmpeg**: `-hwaccel cuda`, `-threads 1`, `filter_threads=1`. One ffmpeg job at a time.
- **Forbidden without explicit user override**:
  - Full-video dense CPU frame OCR / PIL scans
  - Batch Windows OCR on hundreds of frames
  - Parallel detect+encode+OCR pipelines
  - `numpy`/`cv2` full-frame analysis loops
- **Allowed light CPU only**: tiny already-cropped strips, audio peak parse, final metadata/txt, thumbnail text draw.
- If a step needs OCR: **prefilter on GPU-extracted crops first**, OCR **≤40 candidates/video**, serial, with pause. Prefer skipping OCR over cooking the CPU.
- Watch for heat: prefer shorter GPU extract passes over long CPU analysis.

## Source & POV
- Source folder default: `V:/PUBG`
- **Player POV only** — skip spectator / death-cam / teammate-watch
- Skip full **replay control panel** open ranges (never crop the bar). Thin yellow timeline alone is OK.

## Encode
- Default Shorts: 9:16 · 1080x1920 · 60fps · mp4
- Template **MH1** overrides to landscape 16:9 · 1920x1080 (see `pubg-shorts-mh1.mdc`)
- NVENC p5 · CQ 18 · ~12 Mbps (max 16) · AAC 192k · game audio · hard cuts · no in-video text/music
- Portrait crop (1920x1080): w=608 h=1000 x=656 y=40 → scale 1080x1920 (KS1/KS1A only)

## Output package
Always `out/{title}/` with `{title}.mp4`, `.txt`, `.jpg` (+ optional YT), `.meta.json`.
Title: `hook | PUBG`. Don't claim Chicken Dinner unless winner screen present.

## Thumbnail brand (always)
- Prefer **AI-generated** base thumb (Cursor `GenerateImage`) with refs `augniik-character.png` + `augniik-cover.jpg`
- **Aspect**: Shorts `aspect_ratio: "9:16"` · YT `aspect_ratio: "16:9"` — never force-stretch a landscape AI into 9:16 (use cover-crop only)
- Prompt: character is the hero; **NO logos / NO brand marks / NO circular badges**
- Composite **exactly one** logo: `augniik-profile.jpg` (already says AUGNIIK — no extra wordmark/chip)
- **Never** paste a second lobby-character circle on top of AI hero art (that is "double avatar")
- `augniik-character.png` is the AI **reference** for face/outfit/pose — not a second badge
- Fallback: `scripts/make_augniik_thumb.py` (single logo only)
- When user supplies a clearer face/pose shot, replace `augniik-character.png` and reuse for all thumbs

## Clip defaults (templates may override include/exclude)
- Keep ALL my kills/knocks even if over 60s
- Padding ~4s before / ~3s after · merge gap 3s · min 5s · max 30s/clip unless fight needs more
